{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は沈金だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡でライブなので\n観覧もツイキャスもないけど\n収録してきたので中田も出てるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストはЯeaLさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話してる内にどんどん惹かれて\nCD欲しくなって貰って帰っちゃったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひとも聴いてください～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先々週の話ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2＃5\t 配信中です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知遅くなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね\n既に観てくださった方がほとんどかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日キャンプロケに行ったと書いたけど\nそれですね～\nのぎ天2になってから初ロケでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2は少人数でトークが多かったけど\nたまにはみんなでのロケもいいでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、観てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/18/2548334/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/